#!/bin/sh
# Safe limine-install wrapper for live archiso environment
# If no valid EFI system partition exists, no-op cleanly with success
if [[ ! -d /sys/firmware/efi ]] || [[ ! -f /etc/default/limine ]]; then
    exit 0
fi

if [[ -x /usr/bin/limine-install ]]; then
    exec /usr/bin/limine-install "$@"
fi
exit 0
